WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.074
Advertise your product or brand here
contact www.OpenSubtitles.org today

2
00:00:28.825 --> 00:00:30.452
Jae-geol. anyone?

3
00:00:30.577 --> 00:00:32.412
There is no one. sir.

4
00:00:32.454 --> 00:00:34.915
Go deeper. will you?

5
00:00:34.998 --> 00:00:36.375
I really saw someone.

6
00:00:36.416 --> 00:00:37.459
Okay.

7
00:00:57.145 --> 00:00:58.605
Come on.

8
00:01:12.119 --> 00:01:13.245
Is someone there?

9
00:01:59.374 --> 00:02:01.710
GWANGLIM

10
00:02:40.457 --> 00:02:41.792
Good evening!

11
00:02:42.959 --> 00:02:44.544
I'm Kim Da-Kyung.

12
00:02:45.212 --> 00:02:46.838
I called you before.

13
00:03:08.694 --> 00:03:10.070
Thank you. sir.

14
00:03:19.871 --> 00:03:21.581
It's really hot.

15
00:03:21.707 --> 00:03:23.458
So. you're a YouTuber?

16
00:03:24.710 --> 00:03:28.714
A YouTube content creator. to be precise.

17
00:03:34.386 --> 00:03:35.387
Here.

18
00:03:37.556 --> 00:03:38.890
HORROR QUEEN DA-KYUNG

19
00:03:39.057 --> 00:03:40.684
"Horror Queen."

20
00:03:42.227 --> 00:03:43.185
I'm warning you!

21
00:03:43.186 --> 00:03:46.732
If you have a weak heart.
you must leave at once!

22
00:03:47.357 --> 00:03:49.192
I'm Da-Kyung. the Horror Queen.

23
00:04:03.248 --> 00:04:05.584
I guess you wouldn't know.

24
00:04:05.917 --> 00:04:08.086
So. what did you want to see me about?

25
00:04:08.670 --> 00:04:12.506
I heard some rumors

26
00:04:12.507 --> 00:04:16.553
that strange things are
happening at this station.

27
00:04:16.720 --> 00:04:18.013
Is that true?

28
00:04:18.680 --> 00:04:21.224
I'm sorry. May I ask you to leave?

29
00:04:21.433 --> 00:04:22.391
Pardon?

30
00:04:22.392 --> 00:04:24.770
People like you came by often.

31
00:04:24.895 --> 00:04:27.354
Those who profit from other people's pain.

32
00:04:27.355 --> 00:04:29.983
I have nothing to say to those people.

33
00:04:34.154 --> 00:04:35.863
If it's about money...

34
00:04:35.864 --> 00:04:37.199
Did I say I wanted money?

35
00:04:37.407 --> 00:04:38.407
Please leave.

36
00:04:38.408 --> 00:04:40.451
I brought a gift just in case...

37
00:04:40.452 --> 00:04:42.412
How many times do I have to tell you?

38
00:04:46.249 --> 00:04:47.209
Could that be

39
00:04:47.876 --> 00:04:49.211
silkworm spirit?

40
00:04:49.294 --> 00:04:49.920
Yes.

41
00:04:49.921 --> 00:04:53.631
That is Korea's finest spirit. first
produced in Jeolla and Hwanghae

42
00:04:53.632 --> 00:04:55.550
during the Joseon Kingdom era.

43
00:04:56.301 --> 00:04:57.635
How do you have this?

44
00:04:57.636 --> 00:05:00.222
My grandfather is a brewer in Jeonju.

45
00:05:01.973 --> 00:05:03.725
Will you tell me about the rumors?

46
00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:09.648
Even so. I can't.

47
00:05:09.940 --> 00:05:11.065
That's too bad.

48
00:05:11.066 --> 00:05:12.359
How about...

49
00:05:12.859 --> 00:05:14.319
just one story?

50
00:05:24.996 --> 00:05:29.000
This story begins with a young man.

51
00:05:33.964 --> 00:05:35.966
Attention. please.

52
00:05:36.049 --> 00:05:40.470
We've made an emergency
stop due to an issue at the station.

53
00:05:40.595 --> 00:05:41.263
Hello?

54
00:05:41.264 --> 00:05:43.431
We apologize for the inconvenience.

55
00:05:43.557 --> 00:05:47.727
Please wait safely until
the issue is resolved.

56
00:05:47.853 --> 00:05:49.896
Our train will depart shortly.

57
00:06:35.442 --> 00:06:36.943
A Raison French Black. please.

58
00:06:37.944 --> 00:06:39.361
You there!

59
00:06:39.362 --> 00:06:41.865
Don't touch if you're not buying!

60
00:06:48.371 --> 00:06:51.625
No. this is Yogo. I want French Black.

61
00:06:53.919 --> 00:06:57.422
Where's French Black?

62
00:06:59.674 --> 00:07:00.842
Excuse me.

63
00:07:02.385 --> 00:07:05.347
Not there. over there.

64
00:07:07.849 --> 00:07:09.017
Yes. that one.

65
00:07:09.809 --> 00:07:11.978
You're so bad at this.

66
00:07:13.897 --> 00:07:17.275
-Which college do you go to?
-What?

67
00:07:19.861 --> 00:07:24.658
This is Black. that's Yogo.
and both are the same brand.

68
00:07:25.283 --> 00:07:28.285
Then logically. you should
be searching the same shelf.

69
00:07:28.286 --> 00:07:30.330
but you're looking at the wrong spot.

70
00:07:30.914 --> 00:07:31.964
That'll be 9.500 won.

71
00:07:32.123 --> 00:07:33.208
Okay.

72
00:07:38.713 --> 00:07:40.173
You gave me the wrong one.

73
00:07:41.007 --> 00:07:43.009
GANGNAM PREMIUM COLLEGE REMEDIAL CLASS

74
00:07:47.347 --> 00:07:48.890
I gave you the wrong one.

75
00:07:52.018 --> 00:07:54.068
What an asshole. staring at me like that.

76
00:07:55.021 --> 00:07:57.190
She's too dumb to get a real job.

77
00:08:27.721 --> 00:08:31.516
Gosh. what a moron.

78
00:08:41.693 --> 00:08:45.655
The next stop is Yongdam Station.

79
00:08:45.697 --> 00:08:47.949
The doors are on your right.

80
00:10:02.023 --> 00:10:03.191
Holy shit.

81
00:10:07.821 --> 00:10:09.280
What a moron.

82
00:10:10.073 --> 00:10:13.409
Gosh. she's such a dumbass.

83
00:10:24.003 --> 00:10:25.505
Hello?

84
00:10:25.547 --> 00:10:27.757
-What is it?
-Have you had dinner. Son?

85
00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:30.510
Did you drink?

86
00:10:31.678 --> 00:10:33.597
Mom. I'm watching a lecture. I have to go.

87
00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:38.893
Your class said you haven't
attended in two months.

88
00:10:38.977 --> 00:10:40.979
-I got to go.
-I was worried.

89
00:10:45.942 --> 00:10:46.985
Mom?

90
00:10:51.447 --> 00:10:52.574
Mom.

91
00:10:53.616 --> 00:10:54.742
What?

92
00:10:58.913 --> 00:11:01.416
YOUNG WOMAN COMMITS
SUICIDE AT GWANGLIM STATION

93
00:12:48.189 --> 00:12:52.110
The next stop is Gwanglim Station.

94
00:12:52.193 --> 00:12:54.612
The doors are on your right.

95
00:12:55.238 --> 00:13:00.410
You can transfer to line five for
Bangwoo. Hanam Seoksan. and Machon.

96
00:13:00.451 --> 00:13:02.704
The platform gates are closing.

97
00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:17.552
The train to Sinseok has just departed.

98
00:13:17.677 --> 00:13:21.180
The next train will pass this station.

99
00:13:22.056 --> 00:13:26.185
This train will not stop at this station.

100
00:13:26.311 --> 00:13:30.148
Please take a step back
and wait for the next train.

101
00:13:42.327 --> 00:13:45.580
DANGER. DO NOT ENTER

102
00:14:30.124 --> 00:14:32.043
That incident

103
00:14:33.544 --> 00:14:35.380
was ruled a suicide.

104
00:14:46.182 --> 00:14:47.182
That was intriguing.

105
00:14:51.979 --> 00:14:57.026
You got your story. so please leave.

106
00:14:57.819 --> 00:15:00.279
Is it okay if I come...

107
00:15:00.321 --> 00:15:02.240
Don't ever come back.

108
00:15:23.469 --> 00:15:26.119
ANOTHER SUICIDE AT GWANGLIM.
ALREADY THE 6TH INCIDENT

109
00:15:30.685 --> 00:15:32.478
-Da-Kyung.
-What?

110
00:15:34.021 --> 00:15:36.607
-Did I startle you?
-No. it's nothing.

111
00:15:40.445 --> 00:15:44.657
Without your glasses.
your eyes look so pretty.

112
00:15:49.245 --> 00:15:50.580
So. how was it?

113
00:15:51.289 --> 00:15:52.290
I love it.

114
00:15:53.207 --> 00:15:56.502
I knew that story would work out.

115
00:15:57.170 --> 00:16:00.047
Right. that story.

116
00:16:03.050 --> 00:16:06.512
That rail suicide a few years
ago at Gwanglim Station...

117
00:16:06.637 --> 00:16:08.681
Rail suicide?

118
00:16:08.723 --> 00:16:12.018
Jeez. that's so drab.

119
00:16:12.143 --> 00:16:14.020
She's got a good feeling about this one.

120
00:16:14.103 --> 00:16:16.147
Oh. really?

121
00:16:17.607 --> 00:16:21.152
But I wonder if the view count will go up.

122
00:16:21.277 --> 00:16:24.489
Your last story was drab too.

123
00:16:24.614 --> 00:16:27.783
and you lost what few subscribers you had.

124
00:16:27.867 --> 00:16:30.620
Beauty and horror are
completely different.

125
00:16:30.661 --> 00:16:32.872
Plenty of people like drab stuff.

126
00:16:33.039 --> 00:16:34.373
Right.

127
00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:37.626
Your last video was
watched maybe 100 times?

128
00:16:37.627 --> 00:16:40.046
Lina. don't you have a shoot?

129
00:16:40.713 --> 00:16:42.507
That's right.

130
00:16:42.673 --> 00:16:44.342
She doesn't even know anything.

131
00:16:46.552 --> 00:16:48.137
What the heck does she know?

132
00:16:55.603 --> 00:17:00.274
The last one was really great.

133
00:17:00.816 --> 00:17:02.944
but is there anything stronger?

134
00:17:07.323 --> 00:17:10.117
I checked out your channel.

135
00:17:10.868 --> 00:17:15.748
The videos on it had
fewer than a hundred views.

136
00:17:17.708 --> 00:17:21.629
It used to be 100.000.

137
00:17:21.754 --> 00:17:25.174
Then why the sudden drop?

138
00:17:25.466 --> 00:17:26.842
Well. you know...

139
00:17:27.635 --> 00:17:30.930
Beauty YouTubers took over.

140
00:17:31.973 --> 00:17:32.889
I see.

141
00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:37.186
And horror content has run out.

142
00:17:37.520 --> 00:17:39.772
You've done enough.

143
00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.525
Why do you keep pushing yourself?

144
00:17:42.608 --> 00:17:45.778
Because I'm...

145
00:17:48.447 --> 00:17:49.282
I'm...

146
00:17:51.200 --> 00:17:54.579
Da-Kyung. the Horror Queen.

147
00:18:04.964 --> 00:18:08.050
Maybe I should change this.

148
00:18:26.986 --> 00:18:28.738
There was a student.

149
00:18:29.071 --> 00:18:31.699
She endured a lot of pain

150
00:18:31.782 --> 00:18:34.368
to obtain something she didn't have.

151
00:18:47.256 --> 00:18:49.425
BUT... WHAT ABOUT THE NOSE?

152
00:19:02.104 --> 00:19:03.648
What the heck just happened?

153
00:19:03.773 --> 00:19:05.816
Attention. please.

154
00:19:05.941 --> 00:19:10.571
We've made an emergency
stop due to an issue at the station.

155
00:19:11.113 --> 00:19:13.407
We apologize for the inconvenience.

156
00:19:13.449 --> 00:19:17.036
Please wait safely until
the issue is resolved.

157
00:19:17.578 --> 00:19:19.205
Our train will depart shortly.

158
00:19:19.246 --> 00:19:20.706
It must be an accident.

159
00:19:20.748 --> 00:19:22.416
Did someone jump again?

160
00:19:31.550 --> 00:19:32.385
Mi-ju.

161
00:19:35.388 --> 00:19:36.471
Sir!

162
00:19:36.472 --> 00:19:39.725
It's been a long time. How have you been?

163
00:19:40.101 --> 00:19:43.854
The next stop is Sindam Station.

164
00:19:44.063 --> 00:19:46.732
How's your studying going?

165
00:19:48.567 --> 00:19:52.405
You look so grown-up now.

166
00:19:53.739 --> 00:19:55.032
Have you lost weight?

167
00:19:59.286 --> 00:20:03.123
You look even more handsome too.

168
00:20:03.124 --> 00:20:04.667
Stop it.

169
00:20:06.335 --> 00:20:09.672
Sir. did you move?

170
00:20:09.797 --> 00:20:11.172
I went to the café you recommended...

171
00:20:11.173 --> 00:20:14.760
The doors are opening.

172
00:20:15.886 --> 00:20:18.012
-Honey!
-Ji-in!

173
00:20:18.013 --> 00:20:19.597
Why are you standing?
Aren't you going to sit?

174
00:20:19.598 --> 00:20:21.308
The doors are closing.

175
00:20:21.392 --> 00:20:23.435
The train will soon depart.

176
00:20:23.436 --> 00:20:25.312
-The doors are closing.
-Who is she?

177
00:20:25.563 --> 00:20:27.398
She looks so adorable.

178
00:20:28.107 --> 00:20:29.984
She's the student I used to tutor.

179
00:20:30.401 --> 00:20:31.610
Your tutee?

180
00:20:32.319 --> 00:20:35.406
Say hi. This is my girlfriend.

181
00:20:37.742 --> 00:20:40.202
I'm getting off next.

182
00:20:40.953 --> 00:20:44.248
-Sure. okay.
-It was good meeting...

183
00:20:52.423 --> 00:20:54.215
I think she had her double eyelids done.

184
00:20:54.216 --> 00:20:56.051
Don't say that.

185
00:20:56.677 --> 00:20:58.136
What should we eat?

186
00:20:58.137 --> 00:21:00.431
-What should we eat?
-What do you feel like?

187
00:21:05.227 --> 00:21:07.813
The platform gates are closing.

188
00:21:48.270 --> 00:21:53.442
GWANGLIM

189
00:21:57.738 --> 00:22:00.574
Your nose is so pretty.

190
00:22:09.458 --> 00:22:12.211
Your nose is so pretty.

191
00:22:14.463 --> 00:22:15.965
Thank you.

192
00:22:24.223 --> 00:22:26.892
Your nose is so pretty.

193
00:22:37.903 --> 00:22:40.739
Your nose is so pretty.

194
00:25:26.113 --> 00:25:29.408
All officers are currently
busy taking reports.

195
00:25:29.450 --> 00:25:32.036
You'll be connected to an officer shortly.

196
00:25:33.412 --> 00:25:35.205
This is 911.

197
00:25:35.247 --> 00:25:37.207
I'm at a subway station.

198
00:25:37.249 --> 00:25:40.586
There's a crazy person
chasing me with acid.

199
00:25:41.378 --> 00:25:43.881
Someone's chasing you with acid?

200
00:25:44.006 --> 00:25:46.216
I've hidden in the bathroom.

201
00:25:46.258 --> 00:25:48.010
Please tell me your exact location.

202
00:25:48.093 --> 00:25:50.179
Gwanglim Station.

203
00:25:50.679 --> 00:25:52.014
The women's room at Gwanglim Station?

204
00:25:52.056 --> 00:25:55.184
Yes. please come quickly!

205
00:25:55.309 --> 00:25:58.645
Try to stay calm. Could
you describe this woman?

206
00:25:58.771 --> 00:26:00.814
Her face is bandaged.

207
00:26:00.856 --> 00:26:02.483
She's in a hospital gown.

208
00:26:05.486 --> 00:26:08.447
Hello?

209
00:26:10.074 --> 00:26:11.992
How did you know it was a woman?

210
00:26:20.417 --> 00:26:24.755
Your nose is so pretty.

211
00:26:38.852 --> 00:26:40.979
Your face is so pretty.

212
00:27:13.846 --> 00:27:15.514
You don't seem to believe me.

213
00:27:16.390 --> 00:27:18.851
No. it's not that.

214
00:27:21.311 --> 00:27:25.149
Where did you hear this story. sir?

215
00:27:34.116 --> 00:27:38.871
My goodness. I'm getting tipsy.

216
00:27:46.211 --> 00:27:50.549
7.3 million daily subway passengers

217
00:27:50.591 --> 00:27:53.385
spend 35.1 minutes in
subways per day on average.

218
00:27:53.510 --> 00:27:59.141
And Gwanglim records the highest
number of disappearances nationwide.

219
00:28:00.017 --> 00:28:04.438
I am here at Gwanglim Station.

220
00:28:09.484 --> 00:28:12.613
Did you see that? It
must be a poltergeist.

221
00:28:12.654 --> 00:28:14.156
It has to be a poltergeist!

222
00:28:14.281 --> 00:28:16.158
Okay. continue!

223
00:28:16.283 --> 00:28:17.117
Now?

224
00:28:20.037 --> 00:28:22.539
Okay. I...

225
00:28:22.581 --> 00:28:23.624
I'll be...

226
00:28:23.749 --> 00:28:27.669
telling you a mysterious
true story linked to this station.

227
00:28:29.046 --> 00:28:30.339
I'm warning you!

228
00:28:30.380 --> 00:28:34.384
If you have a weak heart.
you must leave at once!

229
00:28:35.177 --> 00:28:37.471
I'm Da-Kyung. the Horror Queen.

230
00:28:48.482 --> 00:28:49.441
How is it?

231
00:28:50.651 --> 00:28:51.485
Da-Kyung.

232
00:28:52.444 --> 00:28:53.403
Yes?

233
00:28:54.947 --> 00:28:56.448
The horror queen is back.

234
00:28:56.490 --> 00:28:58.940
The subject matter is
fun. and the pace is quick.

235
00:28:59.409 --> 00:29:00.577
It's quite good.

236
00:29:03.247 --> 00:29:05.415
Thank... Thank you.

237
00:29:07.542 --> 00:29:09.920
Huh? What's this?

238
00:29:11.922 --> 00:29:13.382
What do you...

239
00:29:13.423 --> 00:29:15.842
What's what?

240
00:29:17.094 --> 00:29:18.053
Did you see that?

241
00:29:27.729 --> 00:29:28.855
What is that?

242
00:29:31.108 --> 00:29:33.735
Isn't that a person?

243
00:29:49.835 --> 00:29:51.420
This is a ghost. right?

244
00:29:53.463 --> 00:29:55.424
Was this ever captured before?

245
00:29:55.924 --> 00:29:57.800
Would you like a drink?

246
00:29:57.801 --> 00:30:00.429
I actually quit drinking.

247
00:30:02.389 --> 00:30:05.976
I heard your views went
up. We should celebrate.

248
00:30:22.617 --> 00:30:24.077
One more glass. please.

249
00:30:39.176 --> 00:30:41.636
What do you think a subway is?

250
00:30:44.306 --> 00:30:45.891
Public transportation.

251
00:30:46.683 --> 00:30:48.310
Usually. yes.

252
00:30:49.144 --> 00:30:51.980
But for some people. it's life itself.

253
00:30:52.731 --> 00:30:55.150
That man's beginning wasn't bad.

254
00:30:55.942 --> 00:30:58.542
He was an ordinary man
like any other office worker.

255
00:30:59.071 --> 00:31:03.325
But little by little. he
started to lose what he had.

256
00:31:03.450 --> 00:31:07.204
He lost a decent job.

257
00:31:07.245 --> 00:31:09.122
and then lost his family.

258
00:31:09.247 --> 00:31:11.708
then. self-restraint.

259
00:31:11.750 --> 00:31:15.087
He kept spiraling downwards.

260
00:31:16.046 --> 00:31:20.592
And he finally reached the cold bottom.

261
00:31:22.052 --> 00:31:23.136
Sir!

262
00:31:24.012 --> 00:31:26.348
Sir!

263
00:31:26.598 --> 00:31:27.766
Wake up!

264
00:31:28.475 --> 00:31:29.684
Come on. wake up.

265
00:31:30.227 --> 00:31:32.270
You can't sleep here.

266
00:31:36.483 --> 00:31:37.859
Oh. dear.

267
00:31:38.026 --> 00:31:40.426
You know very well that
people walk around here.

268
00:31:40.904 --> 00:31:42.406
Please move to that side.

269
00:31:50.414 --> 00:31:52.416
BIG CUP SPICY NOODLE 2.500 WON

270
00:31:54.376 --> 00:31:55.794
You there!

271
00:31:56.128 --> 00:31:58.380
Don't touch if you're not buying!

272
00:32:00.424 --> 00:32:02.551
Every damn day...

273
00:32:03.677 --> 00:32:04.678
Here.

274
00:32:05.303 --> 00:32:09.766
No. this is Yogo. I want French Black.

