01:08:37.535 --> 01:08:42.957
But I'd rather just focus on work
than eat with someone like you.

550
01:08:44.917 --> 01:08:45.752
Woo-jin.

551
01:08:47.420 --> 01:08:48.870
They're looking for Da-Kyung.

552
01:08:52.383 --> 01:08:54.010
May I help you?

553
01:08:54.969 --> 01:08:57.597
I'm Detective Park Ju-ho from Mapo Police.

554
01:08:57.722 --> 01:08:59.349
Do you know where she is?

555
01:09:00.141 --> 01:09:02.143
May I ask what this is about?

556
01:09:02.727 --> 01:09:05.396
We came here after
seeing her YouTube videos.

557
01:09:40.473 --> 01:09:44.852
At 3:34 a.m. on Friday.

558
01:09:45.520 --> 01:09:47.522
a train will arrive.

559
01:09:48.356 --> 01:09:49.941
If you ride that train.

560
01:09:50.983 --> 01:09:53.319
you'll be able to meet him.

561
01:11:19.989 --> 01:11:26.621
The train for... is approaching.

562
01:11:27.789 --> 01:11:33.544
Please board the train safely
after passengers have exited.

563
01:11:38.007 --> 01:11:39.675
PRODUCER WOO-JIN

564
01:11:48.810 --> 01:11:51.270
The train is now arriving.

565
01:11:52.188 --> 01:11:54.357
The platform gates are opening.

566
01:12:00.905 --> 01:12:03.491
Our train will depart shortly.

567
01:15:00.209 --> 01:15:01.043
Excuse me!

568
01:15:01.752 --> 01:15:02.586
Please!

569
01:15:04.005 --> 01:15:04.955
For goodness' sake!

570
01:16:46.190 --> 01:16:47.090
The station master

571
01:16:47.858 --> 01:16:49.360
is a different person?

572
01:16:49.485 --> 01:16:53.572
Yes. but in the video. she
stated that she interviewed him.

573
01:16:53.656 --> 01:16:55.206
and the recording was uploaded.

574
01:16:55.658 --> 01:16:59.078
but the current station
master is a different person.

575
01:16:59.120 --> 01:17:01.455
So...

576
01:17:02.123 --> 01:17:04.583
who has she been interviewing?

577
01:17:07.002 --> 01:17:10.339
A man who went missing three years ago.

578
01:17:30.985 --> 01:17:31.986
Hello?

579
01:17:35.614 --> 01:17:36.574
Hello?

580
01:17:38.492 --> 01:17:41.036
I knew from the first moment I saw you

581
01:17:41.704 --> 01:17:44.707
that your desire would
bring you to this place.

582
01:17:46.125 --> 01:17:49.670
You were always curious
about these stories.

583
01:17:49.753 --> 01:17:52.214
but you were never curious about me.

584
01:17:53.382 --> 01:17:54.633
Who I am

585
01:17:55.342 --> 01:17:58.387
and why I'm telling you these stories.

586
01:18:01.056 --> 01:18:03.350
The last story I'll tell you

587
01:18:04.643 --> 01:18:05.644
is my own.

588
01:18:11.025 --> 01:18:12.985
What are you looking at so intently?

589
01:18:13.944 --> 01:18:14.987
It's just that...

590
01:18:15.821 --> 01:18:18.073
I think I saw someone over there.

591
01:18:18.657 --> 01:18:20.326
-At this hour?
-Yes.

592
01:18:21.285 --> 01:18:23.787
I'm sure someone went in there.

593
01:18:32.213 --> 01:18:35.424
No way! I have to go to the dormitory.

594
01:18:35.549 --> 01:18:36.592
Hey.

595
01:18:36.675 --> 01:18:38.469
Will you stop feeding that damn cat?

596
01:18:38.552 --> 01:18:39.845
That's a pig. not a cat.

597
01:18:40.346 --> 01:18:42.556
He's Ming-Ming. Don't call him a pig.

598
01:18:42.681 --> 01:18:44.683
Stop giving me crap.

599
01:18:45.392 --> 01:18:48.979
What are you going to do if
someone really went in there?

600
01:18:49.521 --> 01:18:51.857
You know how flustered I was

601
01:18:51.982 --> 01:18:54.818
when all those YouTubers came down here

602
01:18:56.153 --> 01:18:58.280
and made all that fuss about some cult.

603
01:18:59.657 --> 01:19:00.991
I went that time too.

604
01:19:02.159 --> 01:19:02.992
Exactly.

605
01:19:04.453 --> 01:19:05.454
So you can go again.

606
01:19:06.705 --> 01:19:08.082
It's always me!

607
01:19:09.959 --> 01:19:13.087
Gosh. who would be in
the station at this hour?

608
01:19:25.808 --> 01:19:27.059
Hello?

609
01:19:28.477 --> 01:19:29.812
Anyone there?

610
01:19:31.689 --> 01:19:32.648
Of course not.

611
01:20:22.656 --> 01:20:23.991
Jae-geol. anyone?

612
01:20:24.783 --> 01:20:26.285
There is no one. sir.

613
01:20:27.786 --> 01:20:30.289
Go deeper. will you?

614
01:20:30.372 --> 01:20:31.790
I really saw someone.

615
01:20:32.541 --> 01:20:33.709
Okay.

616
01:20:37.087 --> 01:20:37.921
Dang it.

617
01:20:48.223 --> 01:20:50.309
Hey. Jae-geol!

618
01:20:50.392 --> 01:20:52.436
Double back the way you came from.

619
01:20:57.691 --> 01:20:58.776
Hello?

620
01:21:01.487 --> 01:21:02.488
Buddy!

621
01:21:04.114 --> 01:21:06.950
It's... so hot...

622
01:21:10.537 --> 01:21:11.538
Hello?

623
01:21:12.456 --> 01:21:13.457
Hey!

624
01:21:28.055 --> 01:21:29.556
Why is it so hot in here?

625
01:21:32.351 --> 01:21:33.852
Jae-geol!

626
01:21:36.105 --> 01:21:37.689
Jae-geol!

627
01:22:27.739 --> 01:22:28.839
Is that you. Jae-geol?

628
01:22:47.217 --> 01:22:48.552
Damn...

629
01:22:50.554 --> 01:22:51.388
Gosh...

630
01:23:12.826 --> 01:23:13.869
What in the world...

631
01:23:55.327 --> 01:23:57.120
What the...

632
01:24:14.221 --> 01:24:15.222
No...

633
01:24:19.685 --> 01:24:20.519
Come on!

634
01:24:24.982 --> 01:24:25.941
Damn it.

635
01:24:55.804 --> 01:24:57.139
What are these?

636
01:25:14.823 --> 01:25:16.283
Shit...

637
01:25:22.122 --> 01:25:23.457
It's hot...

638
01:25:25.542 --> 01:25:26.960
It's hot...

639
01:25:28.587 --> 01:25:30.088
So hot...

640
01:25:30.213 --> 01:25:31.256
It's so hot...

641
01:26:09.419 --> 01:26:11.254
Ouch. that's hot!

642
01:26:13.715 --> 01:26:15.133
Come on!

643
01:26:34.319 --> 01:26:35.946
EMERGENCY BOX

644
01:27:26.788 --> 01:27:27.873
Station Master?

645
01:27:27.956 --> 01:27:28.790
Gosh!

646
01:27:31.918 --> 01:27:32.753
Station Master?

647
01:27:35.881 --> 01:27:38.216
Hello? Jae-geol?

648
01:27:39.217 --> 01:27:41.136
I'm over here.

649
01:27:41.219 --> 01:27:45.724
Jae-geol. I'm trapped inside a train.

650
01:27:46.391 --> 01:27:47.517
Where are you?

651
01:27:49.060 --> 01:27:50.103
Sir.

652
01:27:50.187 --> 01:27:51.146
I can see you.

653
01:27:52.189 --> 01:27:54.149
Jae-geol. where are you?!

654
01:27:54.191 --> 01:27:55.025
On my way...

655
01:27:56.193 --> 01:27:57.444
I... see you.

656
01:27:57.986 --> 01:27:59.738
Be ri... there... Station Master?

657
01:28:02.157 --> 01:28:03.492
You can see me?

658
01:28:19.758 --> 01:28:21.009
Hey!

659
01:28:21.092 --> 01:28:21.927
My gosh.

660
01:29:09.307 --> 01:29:10.392
No!

661
01:29:10.517 --> 01:29:13.019
No! Please!

662
01:29:13.103 --> 01:29:16.857
Open the door! Open up!

663
01:29:16.982 --> 01:29:19.693
Open the damn door!

664
01:29:40.672 --> 01:29:41.882
I'm sure you heard

665
01:29:42.883 --> 01:29:46.219
that this station used
to be the cult's chapel.

666
01:29:48.638 --> 01:29:51.057
I can let you meet him.

667
01:29:56.980 --> 01:29:57.814
No.

668
01:30:01.985 --> 01:30:02.819
No.

669
01:30:03.820 --> 01:30:05.488
Please open the door.

670
01:30:06.448 --> 01:30:08.575
Open this door!

671
01:30:21.379 --> 01:30:24.841
I quite enjoyed our time together.

672
01:30:26.593 --> 01:30:27.510
I'll...

673
01:30:29.220 --> 01:30:30.513
miss you.

674
01:30:32.140 --> 01:30:33.016
No...

675
01:30:36.144 --> 01:30:40.023
Open the door. please!

676
01:30:40.106 --> 01:30:41.691
Open the door!

677
01:30:41.816 --> 01:30:42.943
Sir.

678
01:30:44.027 --> 01:30:45.820
Please! No!

679
01:30:46.613 --> 01:30:48.490
No!

680
01:30:52.744 --> 01:30:53.787
No.

681
01:31:36.913 --> 01:31:40.291
The train to Sinseok has just departed.

682
01:32:12.073 --> 01:32:13.324
Da-Kyung.

683
01:32:16.077 --> 01:32:18.877
Why did you never answer
your phone? I was so worried...

684
01:32:40.393 --> 01:32:41.478
Woo-jin.

685
01:32:41.519 --> 01:32:44.355
Do you want me to tell
you an interesting story?

686
01:32:45.305 --> 01:33:45.837
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
